# Canonical host: send the apex to www with a 301.
#
# Cloudflare Pages only matches path-only sources in _redirects, so an absolute
# "https://empirestatebulldogs.com/*" source is silently ignored and both hostnames
# serve the same deployment. The apex->www redirect is therefore configured as a
# Cloudflare Redirect Rule on the zone instead (Rules > Redirect Rules), not here.
#
# Keep this file for genuine path redirects. Example:
# /old-path  /new-path  301
